``` LF-01 | Daily License Usage by Index, Sourcetype, and Host vs. Quota
    Interpretation and RCA: Splunk Administrator Field Manual (Gaurav Malik),
    entry LF-01. https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0HRXCT384

    Run on: SH for usage, LM for the | rest quota join.
    Query: Top sourcetypes and hosts for yesterday (SH)
    If this returns nothing, run probes/LF-01-probe.spl,
    probes/LF-01-probe-rest.spl to confirm the data it reads exists here.
```
index=_internal source=*license_usage.log* type=Usage earliest=-1d@d latest=@d
| stats sum(b) as bytes by st h
| eval gb=round(bytes / 1024 / 1024 / 1024, 3)
| sort - bytes
| head 25
| table st h gb
